---|---  
Default:   
Context:  |  `stream`, `server`  
This directive appeared in version 0.7.0. 
Specifies a `_file_`with trusted CA certificates in the PEM format used to[verify](https://nginx.org/en/docs/njs/reference.html#fetch_verify) the HTTPS certificate with [Fetch API](https://nginx.org/en/docs/njs/reference.html#ngx_fetch). 
